control: A mutation patch is refused when a hunk's context matches at more than one place in its file
removes: a hunk is matched over lines an earlier hunk wrote, which git apply never does
packages: ./testsupport/cmd/mutproof/...
tests: TestHunkMatchNeverMatchesOverAnEarlierHunk
scheduled-count: no

